"description": "CBIZ, Inc. is a professional services advisor to middle market businesses and organizations nationwide. It offers its services in accounting, tax, advisory, benefits, insurance, and technology. It operates through the following segments: Financial Services, Benefits and Insurance Services, and National Practices. The Financial Services segment offers accounting, tax, government health care consulting, financial advisory, valuation, and risk advisory services. The Benefits and Insurance Services segment includes group health benefits consulting, property and casualty brokerage, retirement plan services, and payroll. The company was founded in 1987 and is headquartered in Independence, OH.",
